Subject: [PATCH] Datalogger changes

---
 arch/arm/dts/imx6ull-datalogger.dts           | 219 ++++++
 arch/arm/dts/imx6ull-datalogger.dtsi          | 647 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm/mach-imx/mx6/Kconfig                 |  12 +
 board/cleanmobility/datalogger/Kconfig        |  17 +
 board/cleanmobility/datalogger/Makefile       |   4 +
 .../datalogger/imx6ull-datalogger.c           | 242 +++++++
